  "releaseNotes": "Refactored FeatureManager to use static field instead of ThreadLocal, fixing cross-thread license visibility issues. Added LicenseClient.TryAutoValidateAsync() for automatic cache-based validation on app startup. Added LicenseClient.ValidateAndCacheAsync() for validating license files with automatic caching. Added CacheValidationResult and CacheValidationStatus for structured cache validation outcomes. Simplified WinForms test app to use new SDK methods. Removed all ConfigureAwait(false) calls from SDK for cleaner async handling.",
